'''Coin Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Nyanko Rangers (Event Gacha)|Nyanko Rangers]] Event Gacha. It was added in [[Version 6.6 Update|Version 6.6]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 375
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Coin Cat
|name2 = Macho Coin Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Macho Coin Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Very similar to [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]] in terms of usage. Cheap and expendable, it can be summoned en masse to take hits in place of other, more important units. This meatshield role is quite valuable, if not for the wide selection of cats able to perform this role. Coin Cat, however, can be used in {{4c}} stages, where there is considerably less competition. Do not expect Coin Cat to take a hit from any enemy and live.

{{Job|Classification = Meatshield}}

